    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Description Translation:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immerse yourself in this deep, strategic mobile industry simulation game!</strong> Step into the role of a visionary tech tycoon and build your mobile empire from the ground up. Manage every facet of your company\u2014oversee departments, design cutting-edge smartphones, develop proprietary operating systems, negotiate supply chains, and orchestrate high-stakes product launches. Climb to the pinnacle of the mobile era and prove yourself as the ultimate champion of the smartphone revolution!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Corporate Management</strong><br>Command specialized departments, each with unique roles and functions. Recruit talent across diverse roles to boost efficiency, but tread carefully\u2014employee personalities can make or break your team\u2019s performance.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Design &amp; Development</strong><br>Craft smartphones with limitless creativity. Hardware specs, software ecosystems, and OS choices (build from scratch or adopt open-source?) all lie in your hands. Negotiate fiercely with suppliers to slash costs, then set the perfect launch price to dominate the market.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Global Markets &amp; Stock Trading</strong><br>Strategize across worldwide markets\u2014balance investments and nurture key partnerships. Take your company public to attract investors, or dive into stock trading to flex your financial mastery.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you seize the throne of the mobile era?</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Description Translation:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immerse yourself in this deep, strategic mobile industry simulation game!</strong> Step into the role of a visionary tech tycoon and build your mobile empire from the ground up. Manage every facet of your company\u2014oversee departments, design cutting-edge smartphones, develop proprietary operating systems, negotiate supply chains, and orchestrate high-stakes product launches. Climb to the pinnacle of the mobile era and prove yourself as the ultimate champion of the smartphone revolution!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Corporate Management</strong><br>Command specialized departments, each with unique roles and functions. Recruit talent across diverse roles to boost efficiency, but tread carefully\u2014employee personalities can make or break your team\u2019s performance.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Design &amp; Development</strong><br>Craft smartphones with limitless creativity. Hardware specs, software ecosystems, and OS choices (build from scratch or adopt open-source?) all lie in your hands. Negotiate fiercely with suppliers to slash costs, then set the perfect launch price to dominate the market.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Global Markets &amp; Stock Trading</strong><br>Strategize across worldwide markets\u2014balance investments and nurture key partnerships. Take your company public to attract investors, or dive into stock trading to flex your financial mastery.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you seize the throne of the mobile era?</strong></p>",
